<title>USA: Charter Comms names new chairman, CFO.</title>
<headline>Charter Comms names new chairman, CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charter Communications International Inc said on Friday its board of directors had named Stephen Raville chairman and Patrick Delaney chief financial officer.  </p>
<p>The company in a statement said Raville replaced David Olson, who will remain as chief executive and a director. Raville is president of First Southeastern Corp.</p>
<p>Delaney is a board member. He succeeds John Reiland, who resigned to pursue another business interest.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
